{"id":"H5900","lemma":"עִירוּ","transliteration":"iru","sayIt":"I-ru","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Iru","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.15;\nson of: Caleb (H3612);\nbrother of: Achsah (H5915), Elah (H0425J) and Naam (H5277)\n§ Iru = \"watch\"\nson of Caleb and grandson of Jephunneh","glosses":["iru"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Iru","kjv":"Iru"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:15","note":"The sons of Caleb the son of Jephunneh: Iru, Elah, and Naam. The son of Elah: Kenaz.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0425","lemma":"אֵלָה","transliteration":"elah","gloss":"Elah"},{"id":"H3612","lemma":"כָּלֵב","transliteration":"kalev","gloss":"Caleb"},{"id":"H5277","lemma":"נָ֑עַם","transliteration":"naam","gloss":"Naam"},{"id":"H5915","lemma":"עַכְסָה","transliteration":"akhsah","gloss":"Achsah"},{"id":"H3614","lemma":"כָּלִבִּי","transliteration":"kalibbo","gloss":"Calebite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}